#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:1
msgid ""
"CellLocators: Make sure that when a tolerance parameter is available it can "
"be used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:3
msgid ""
"`vtkCellLocator`, `vtkStaticCellLocator`, `vtkCellTreeLocator`, "
"`vtkModifiedBSPTree`, `vtkOBBTree`, `vtkLinearTransformCellLocator` have the "
"following functions that have a tolerance parameter, but it was not used in "
"the implementation. Now it is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:7
msgid "`InsideCellBounds`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:8
msgid "`IntersectWithLine`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:9
msgid "`FindCell`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:10
msgid "`FindCellsAlongLine`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:11
msgid "`FindCellsAlongPlane`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:13
msgid ""
"The following `vtkAbstractCellLocator` functions are no longer virtual, "
"since they are calling other functions internally, which the subclasses may "
"implement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:16
msgid "`vtkIdType FindCell(double x[3]);`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:17
msgid ""
"`vtkIdType FindCell(double x[3], double tol2, vtkGenericCell* GenCell, "
"double pcoords[3], double* weights);`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:18
msgid ""
"`void FindCellsAlongLine(const double p1[3], const double p2[3], double tol, "
"vtkIdList* cells);`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:20
msgid ""
"Some other classes and tests that previously pretended to use the tolerance "
"(without actually using it) has been updated accordingly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:23
msgid "`vtkBinCellDataFilter`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:24
msgid "`TestResampleWithDataSet3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:25
msgid "Test `CellTreeLocator`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:27
msgid "And new tests have been added in TestCellLocatorsEdgeCases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md:29
msgid ""
"because of these changes, since `vtkAbstractCellLocator` don't use "
"`vtkLocator::Tolerance`, `vtkLocator::Tolerance` has been deprecated, and "
"only `vtkAbstractPointLocator` has it now."
msgstr ""
